#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wm-a11y-sensory-governor.php
msgid "WM Accessibility Sensory Governor & Contrast Tokenizer"
msgstr "WM Barrierefreiheit Sensory Governor & Kontrast-Tokenizer"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wm-a11y-sensory-governor.php
msgid "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-a11y-sensory-governor/"
msgstr "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-a11y-sensory-governor/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-a11y-sensory-governor.php
msgid ""
"Prints WCAG 2.2 focus-ring (SC 2.4.11 Focus Not Obscured) and reduced-motion "
"(SC 2.3.3) CSS into the site head and calculates colour-contrast ratios in "
"the admin, over REST and on WP-CLI."
msgstr ""
"Gibt Fokus-Ring- (WCAG 2.2 SC 2.4.11 Focus Not Obscured) und Reduced-Motion-"
"CSS (SC 2.3.3) im Seitenkopf aus und berechnet Farbkontrastverhältnisse im "
"Backend, per REST und über WP-CLI."

